1143	
1144	### 8.1 Manifest (R1)
1145	
1146	Write `manifest.py`. For each file, extract:
1147	
1148	1. every markdown heading (level + text);
1149	2. every ID that matches the union of the family regexes in §5, recording where each is **defined** (heading or bold lead) and where it is **referenced**;
1150	3. every table row (normalized whitespace), with a hash;
1151	4. every `- [ ]` / `- [x]` item;
1152	5. every line starting with `- **Check:**`, `- **Lab:**`, `- **GCP lens:**`, `- **Attack:**`, `- **Defense pattern:**`, `- **Primer:**`, `- **Trade-offs:**`, or `- **Core:**` — and in general any `- **Label:**` line;
1153	6. every Appendix K key entry;
